<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed lower in active trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 556.71, off 0.63.</p>
<p>Losers beat gainers 301 to 211.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.01.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 20,101,600, compared with 14,004,720 Wednesday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EDT/2045 GMT)</p>
